Registers of the uniform Proposition 14 core (all `< 56`, outside `gT` and `pT`):

  `1 K`, `3 S`, `4 r`, `5 H`, `19 ES k`, `20 B'`, `21 P`, `22 D`, `23 ρ`, `27 k`, `28 q₀`,
